 486:app/prog/FuncSafe/fSafeXS.c **** /** Start or continue the application-specific start up process.
 487:app/prog/FuncSafe/fSafeXS.c ****     In order to start or continue an applications start up phase, control is
ARM GAS  C:\Users\SX2605~1.HOD\AppData\Local\Temp\ccVk4ZuO.s 			page 10


 488:app/prog/FuncSafe/fSafeXS.c ****    transferred to this routine.
 489:app/prog/FuncSafe/fSafeXS.c **** 
