 683:app/prog/FuncSafe/fSafeXS.c **** /** Get external watchdog state.
 684:app/prog/FuncSafe/fSafeXS.c ****     Read in the state of the external watchdog.
 685:app/prog/FuncSafe/fSafeXS.c **** 
 686:app/prog/FuncSafe/fSafeXS.c ****     \return     bool    true, the watchdog remains in its safe state, false
 687:app/prog/FuncSafe/fSafeXS.c ****    otherwise\n
 688:app/prog/FuncSafe/fSafeXS.c **** 
 689:app/prog/FuncSafe/fSafeXS.c ****     \pre        None\n
