 691:app/prog/FuncSafe/fSafeXS.c ****    when triggering the external watchdog and subsequently reading back its state
 692:app/prog/FuncSafe/fSafeXS.c ****    again there might be some hysteresis to be taken into consideration. This
 693:app/prog/FuncSafe/fSafeXS.c ****    has to be solved at application level as this depends on a specific project.
 694:app/prog/FuncSafe/fSafeXS.c ****     \note       to be overloaded according to a project specific needs\n
